# Modelfile for Venkatesh Bommeparthi LLM
# 
# NOTE: True 'ollama run' with the native llama.cpp execution engine is not achievable 
# because this model uses a custom character-level tokenizer (vocab size 182) and a custom 
# GPT-2-style architecture that cannot be directly mapped to standard BPE-based GGUF 
# architectures supported by Ollama/llama.cpp.
# 
# Therefore, this Modelfile creates a placeholder model in Ollama pointing to the tiny 
# srinivasa-gpt2:latest model as a base. The actual Venkatesh Bommeparthi LLM is served 
# via the python serve.py HTTP server.

FROM srinivasa-gpt2:latest

# Define the system prompt documenting how to run inference using serve.py
SYSTEM """
Venkatesh Bommeparthi Custom LLM (~1.03M parameters).
This is a placeholder entry in Ollama. Because of the custom character-level tokenizer 
and architecture, the actual inference is served by the python serve.py wrapper at 
http://127.0.0.1:11743/api/generate.

To generate text, run the following curl command:
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:11743/api/generate -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"prompt": "Venkatesh Bommeparthi is", "max_tokens": 100, "temperature": 0.8}'
"""

PARAMETER temperature 0.8
